# Database Design Rules

- Ledger events are append-only after settle; no silent UPDATE/DELETE of settled rows.
- Bible versions are immutable INSERT-only rows.
- Every tenant table includes `project_id` with an index.
- Foreign keys and composite UNIQUE constraints as in `docs/schema-draft.md`.
- Never overwrite settled character state — append compensating events.
- Migrations via Alembic (Phase 1+); one logical change per revision.
- Context queries must be bounded (LIMIT); no full novel loads.
